<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.31 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.61 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.50 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Sales		    7.75 vs   6.83</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.49 vs   5.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.09 vs  10.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.12 vs   7.43</p>
<p> Sales		   79.07 vs  70.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
